
!! Learning Rust
*[[Rust Concept Mapping]]. What concepts are used in Rust. 

* See [ext[this|https://www.embeddedrelated.com/showarticle/1432.php]] for a list of learning resources (with a focus on ''embedded'').

!! Becoming better with Rust 

* The book [ext[Effective Rust|https://effective-rust.com/preface.html]] provides more depth on how to use concepts that exist in Rust within a development context. 

* The site [ext[Blessed.rs|https://blessed.rs/crates]] provide a list of the most important crates. 

